  ('Organiser', 'GB', "Hello, Greenvale Music Festival volunteer office, Martha speaking."),
  ('Student', 'AU', "Hi, I saw on your website that you're looking for volunteers for this summer's festival, and I'd like to find out more."),
  ('Organiser', 'GB', "Great, thanks for calling. The festival runs for three days, from Friday the eighth of August to Sunday the tenth. Volunteers work three shifts of eight hours during the festival, and in return you get a free ticket for the whole weekend, which normally costs two hundred and forty pounds."),
  ('Student', 'AU', "That sounds like a good deal. What kind of jobs are there?"),
