  ('Student', 'AU', "I'm twenty-two."),
  ('Organiser', 'GB', "Perfect. The children's area runs activities like face painting, craft workshops and storytelling, and there's a small stage for children's bands. Shifts there are during the day only, between ten in the morning and six in the evening, so you'd have your evenings free to see the main bands."),
  ('Student', 'AU', "Even better. Where do volunteers stay?"),
  ('Organiser', 'GB', "There's a separate volunteers' campsite, which is quieter than the main one and has its own showers and a kitchen tent. You need to bring your own tent and sleeping bag. Meals are provided during your shifts, and you'll get a voucher for one hot meal a day from any food stall on site."),
  ('Student', 'AU', "Do I have to attend any training?"),
